    <h3>Limitations</h3>
    <p>
      This assessment is automated and may not identify all vulnerabilities present in the application.
      Logic flaws, business logic vulnerabilities, and issues requiring deep application context may
      not be detected. Manual penetration testing is recommended for comprehensive coverage.
      Results are accurate as of the scan date; the security posture may change as the application evolves.
    </p>

